<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Office Depot cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Office Depot cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it raised its rating on Office Depot Inc to buy from neutral with a 12-to-16-month price target of $23.</p>
<p>-- said in a note believes Office Depot is wrongly perceived as the &quot;step-child in a failed merger.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said, &quot;We believe Office Depot will benefit most from a more rational pricing environment in the coming year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- last week Office Depot and Staples Inc terminated their proposed merger after a federal judge allowed regulators to block the deal.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 2/16 to 16-11/16.</p>
</text>
